#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file bgadvanced_ui.ui line 294
#: rc.cpp:88 rc.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Choose here the maximum number of text lines below an icon on the desktop. "
"Longer text will be truncated at the end of the last line."
